[
  {
    "id": 2015006110010,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ふぅ……はふぅ……\r\nあ……プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030150030",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00008",
    "bgm": "006",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110010",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花、ステージお疲れ様\r\nどうだった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……甜花、いっぱい頑張った……\r\n寒かったけど……今は、ぽかぽか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、いっぱい動いた証拠だな\r\nでも、寒くなってきたら我慢しないようにな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "せっかくのいいステージだったんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "いいステージ……にへへ、褒められちゃった……\r\n…………",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花、どうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "冬って、寒いから……あんまり、外に出なかったけど……\r\n動いたら、あったかいんだね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "寒い時……なーちゃんが、外で遊ぼうって、言って……\r\n甜花、いっつもやだって言ってたんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なんで寒い時に、寒いとこ行くんだろって思ってたけど……\r\n今ならちょっとだけ、理由……わかる気がする……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nじゃあ、今度は甘奈と遊びに行けるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……今度、誘ってくれたら……\r\n一緒に行こうかな……たまに……甜花に、できそうなら……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "きっと、甘奈も喜ぶだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\nなーちゃんが喜んでくれるの、甜花も……楽しみ……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……あ、でも……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "こたつでゲームも……冬しかできない……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "身体……肩まで、入れて……ぬくぬくしながら、\r\nゲームするの……気持ちいい……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花らしい冬の楽しみ方だな\r\nそれはそれで楽しまないと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "年末……いっぱい新作ゲーム、出るから……\r\nいっぱい買い込んで、積み上げて、どんどん崩すの……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ごろごろ……ぬくぬく……\r\n甜花の、幸せの時間……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、\r\n甜花の話を聞いてると、俺もやりたくなってくるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ほ、ほんと……？\r\nじゃあ……プロデューサーさんも、今度一緒に……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだなぁ\r\n甜花はどんなのがやりたいんだ？",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ、RPGも、FPSも、好き……\r\n年末なら、大作ゲームも出るし……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ……！　こたつなら、アイス食べるのもいいな……\r\nおやつとか、ジュースも準備して……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110170,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そしたらこたつから、出ないでずっと遊べる……\r\n甜花のお城、作るの……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、それだけ準備してたら\r\nずっとこたつの中にいられそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ……でも……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんと、\r\nこたつに入るなら……事務所しかない……よね？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110200,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "んと……事務所のテーブル……\r\nこたつに、できないかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110210,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\n甜花の家で……一緒にこたつ、入る……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花の家は、さすがにダメだと思うけど……\r\n事務所のも、無理じゃないか……？",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110220,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そっか……プロデューサーさんと……\r\nこたつで、ぬくぬくしたかったな……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "う……そ、それじゃあ……\r\nこたつにしてほしいってはづきさんに言ってみるか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110230,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ほ、ほんとに……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "できるかは、聞いてみないとわからないけど……\r\n言ってみるだけ、だからな",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110240,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……\r\nにへへ……プロデューサーさんと、ぬくぬく……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（甜花がここまで楽しみにしてるなら、\r\nはづきさんと社長に、ちゃんと頼んでみるかな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110250,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ゲームして、アイス食べて、お菓子食べて、\r\nいっぱい遊んだら、一緒にお昼寝したい……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こたつで昼寝したら風邪をひくから、\r\nほどほどにな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110260,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……！\r\nほどほどに、お昼寝する……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015006110270,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "アイドルに……ごろごろに……\r\nプロデューサーさんと一緒の冬……楽しいね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500611/2015006110270"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]